        "source_quote": "弟詢之，驍敢有氣力，元凶夙聞其名，以副輔國將軍張柬。",
        "reading": "詢之以勇力聞，劉劭令其副輔國將軍張柬。",
        "note": "詢之以勇力聞，劉劭令其副輔國將軍張柬。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 26,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:received_sentence1-26",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AB",
        "source_quote": "時張超首行大逆，亦領軍隸柬。",
        "reading": "張超即二凶傳張超之，部屬張柬。",
        "note": "張超即二凶傳張超之，部屬張柬。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 26,
        "end_codepoint": 40,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:received_sentence1-40",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AB",
        "source_quote": "詢之規殺之，慮柬不同，柬宿有此志，又未測詢之同否，互相觀察。",
        "reading": "詢之欲殺超之，憂張柬不肯協同。張柬原有此意，彼此試探。",
        "note": "詢之欲殺超之，憂張柬不肯協同。張柬原有此意，彼此試探。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 40,
        "end_codepoint": 70,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:received_sentence1-70",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AB",
        "source_quote": "會超來論事，柬色動，詢之覺之，即共定謀，遣信召超。",
        "reading": "見張超來訪時柬神色異動，詢之合謀遣人召超。",
        "note": "見張超來訪時柬神色異動，詢之合謀遣人召超。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 70,
        "end_codepoint": 95,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:received_sentence1-95",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AB",
        "source_quote": "超疑之不至，改宿他所。",
        "reading": "張超起疑而更換住處。",
        "note": "張超起疑而更換住處。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 95,
        "end_codepoint": 106,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:received_sentence1-106",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AB",
        "source_quote": "詢之不知其移，逕斫之，殺其僕於牀，因與柬南奔。",
        "reading": "詢之誤殺超之僕，張柬同逃。",
        "note": "詢之誤殺超之僕，張柬同逃。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 106,
        "end_codepoint": 129,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:received_sentence1-129",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AB",
        "source_quote": "柬溺淮死，詢之得至。",
        "reading": "張柬渡淮溺死，詢之抵達。",
        "note": "張柬渡淮溺死，詢之抵達。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 129,
        "end_codepoint": 139,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:received_sentence1-139",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AB",
        "source_quote": "時世祖已即位，以為積弩將軍。",
        "reading": "宋孝武即位，以詢之為積弩將軍。",
        "note": "宋孝武即位，以詢之為積弩將軍。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-xunzhi:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 139,
